<h3>Trusted flaggers</h3>

<p>
    Under article 22 of the DSA, platforms are required to prioritize valid notifications regarding allegedly
    unlawful content submitted by entities designated as trusted flaggers by the Digital Services Coordinator.
</p>
<p>
    Have you been designated by the Digital Services Coordinator as a trusted flagger and do you want to file a
    valid notification? If so, you can contact us at
    <a href="mailto:digitalservicesact@adultwebmasternet.com">digitalservicesact@adultwebmasternet.com</a>.
</p>
